\newlabel{fig:sweeps}{{2}{15}{Group DRO ablations over step size and adjustment $C$: worst-country (top) and pooled (bottom) PR-AUC. Each point reuses the tuned \arm {mlp\_dro} parameters and changes one setting. Step size 0 is plain training on group-balanced batches}{figure.caption.19}{}}
